{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":92673,\"title\":\"Hercules Against the Mongols\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Though Genghis Khan eventually sought peace with the West, his death in 1227 AD puts into power his three war-like sons: Sayan, Susdal, and Kin Khan. These sons quickly overrun the city of Tuleda and take prisoner Princess Bianca, though young Prince Alessio escapes. Hercules comes to the rescue of Bianca, winning her freedom in a tournament in exchange for becoming a slave himself. Forces from the West soon come to re-take Tuleda and Hercules -- freed from his bonds -- helps to dispatch Genghis Khan's three sons while again saving Bianca and reuniting her with her young brother.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dC1UoLpV71l8CpBRL3mjD61YasE.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/taXlkItmPt9fUU2xbxcNCAmZux1.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"voteCount\":10,\"year\":1963,\"runtime\":90,\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"IT\",\"name\":\"Italy\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Domenico Paolella\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":45030,\"name\":\"Domenico Paolella\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8CfAHPKC5yuNcClugKydmOQyXjT.jpg\"},{\"id\":980234,\"name\":\"Mark Forest\",\"character\":\"Maciste\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aT9uLOnjzPWPkYK3YJSVp8DTtmd.jpg\"},{\"id\":1046559,\"name\":\"José Greci\",\"character\":\"Bianca de Tuleda\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rYKUN0nAWaTJ2pJLKzWJAskdX7j.jpg\"},{\"id\":25791,\"name\":\"Maria Grazia Spina\",\"character\":\"Ljuba\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8Fa3zBBRUqK9Ip6wCpHyLRdE1ii.jpg\"},{\"id\":89162,\"name\":\"Ken Clark\",\"character\":\"Sayan\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sFZrOhdCbZPeuw0hsAZ5oLF76En.jpg\"},{\"id\":27383,\"name\":\"Howard Ross\",\"character\":\"Susdal (as Renato Rossini)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bHjanPW2tJ9nzOxj8tq6RZ7E6pN.jpg\"},{\"id\":1046560,\"name\":\"Nadir Moretti\",\"character\":\"Kin Khan (as Nadir Baltimore)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fCGe9p3biBVMvJIG0IdWKQ5oTkU.jpg\"},{\"id\":1046561,\"name\":\"Tullio Altamura\",\"character\":\"Osvaldo\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1Fmof8OeWWR0pXqAc1MwQlpXpn0.jpg\"},{\"id\":1016082,\"name\":\"Bianca Doria\",\"character\":\"Raja\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dc7BSN066yxRQHTsTxWNuTIaVbQ.jpg\"},{\"id\":1046563,\"name\":\"Fedele Gentile\",\"character\":\"Bernard\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fMVPhRCatLHuCalI5aeLKw5qTXF.jpg\"},{\"id\":7196,\"name\":\"Loris Loddi\",\"character\":\"Alessio\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5fmsQA9Hn5NKu7FRGpElJy7hxPp.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1560520,\"title\":\"Batman: Knightfall Part 1: Knightfall\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/360qdtu2hLnqMu8SVHMywn420w1.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/caBIySpwuFi2i7ynvHIlnxJLOdN.jpg\",\"rating\":9.1,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Arkham Asylum has been destroyed, and all its inmates have been unleashed upon Gotham City. As Batman races to round up some of his greatest enemies, he is pushed to his physical and mental limits and into a final confrontation with a new threat: the man called Bane!\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":98,\"title\":\"Gladiator\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aDb548BOkFfI4nFm0kx8A3Ezh7H.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Ar7QuJ7sJEiC0oP3I8fKBKIQD9u.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2000,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the death of Emperor Marcus Aurelius, his devious son takes power and demotes Maximus, one of Rome's most capable generals who Marcus preferred. Eventually, Maximus is forced to become a gladiator and battle to the death against other men for the amusement of paying audiences.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1284465,\"title\":\"The Death of Robin Hood\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/13MmRwmG5NmaMfU8qNrtgGXisiD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lh3BDkmWJh998n4fQcHYcVi7dpm.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Grappling with his past after a life of crime and murder, Robin Hood finds himself gravely injured after a battle he thought would be his last. In the hands of a mysterious woman, he is offered a chance at salvation.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1495,\"title\":\"Kingdom of Heaven\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2NaFdWy9hkM35vZB1hkqsnTcms8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kP8rK9dGS1pr0HrnmXfIi2heWjo.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After his wife dies, a blacksmith named Balian is thrust into royalty, political intrigue and bloody holy wars during the Crusades.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":558449,\"title\":\"Gladiator II\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2cxhvwyEwRlysAmRH4iodkvo0z5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tOqIwliWMovSIZ9DyvHcHI7p2im.jpg\",\"rating\":6.6,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Years after witnessing the death of the revered hero Maximus at the hands of his uncle, Lucius is forced to enter the Colosseum after his home is conquered by the tyrannical Emperors who now lead Rome with an iron fist. With rage in his heart and the future of the Empire at stake, Lucius must look to his past to find strength and honor to return the glory of Rome to its people.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1011477,\"title\":\"Karate Kid: Legends\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c90Lt7OQGsOmhv6x4JoFdoHzw5l.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7Q2CmqIVJuDAESPPp76rWIiA0AD.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a family tragedy, kung fu prodigy Li Fong is uprooted from his home in Beijing and forced to move to New York City with his mother. When a new friend needs his help, Li enters a karate competition – but his skills alone aren't enough. Li's kung fu teacher Mr. Han enlists original Karate Kid Daniel LaRusso for help, and Li learns a new way to fight, merging their two styles into one for the ultimate martial arts showdown.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":254,\"title\":\"King Kong\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6a2HY6UmD7XiDD3NokgaBAXEsD2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mRM2NB0i3wv4HqxXvwIjEVi4Qqq.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2005,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1933 New York, an overly ambitious movie producer coerces his cast and hired ship crew to travel to mysterious Skull Island, where they encounter Kong, a giant ape who is immediately smitten with the leading lady.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":7451,\"title\":\"xXx\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xeEw3eLeSFmJgXZzmF2Efww0q3s.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qwK9soQmmJ7kRdjLZVXblw3g7AQ.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Xander Cage is your standard adrenaline junkie with no fear and a lousy attitude. When the US Government \\\"recruits\\\" him to go on a mission, he's not exactly thrilled. His mission: to gather information on an organization that may just be planning the destruction of the world, led by the nihilistic Yorgi.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":79,\"title\":\"Hero\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vxgZto2Cz7ILHAlmRXt50I2brB2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jDz6RYN3nKYtlo7J9IMvGoJit7B.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During China's Warring States period, a district prefect arrives at the palace of Qin Shi Huang, claiming to have killed the three assassins who had made an attempt on the king's life three years ago.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Adventure\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":147441,\"title\":\"Exodus: Gods and Kings\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uaDj37JtvLan9tihxZ18e6qL33b.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hJ1jUw8irCiWwQk7BElxF92BrlK.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The defiant leader Moses rises up against the Egyptian Pharaoh Ramses, setting 400,000 slaves on a monumental journey of escape from Egypt and its terrifying cycle of deadly plagues.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1084736,\"title\":\"The Count of Monte Cristo\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sAT1P3FGhtJ68anUyJScnMu8t1l.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bxT8jFcWNuWK5LmVo1oGhAm4dnZ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Edmond Dantès becomes the target of a sinister plot and is arrested on his wedding day for a crime he did not commit. After 14 years in the island prison of Château d’If, he manages a daring escape. Now rich beyond his dreams, he assumes the identity of the Count of Monte-Cristo and exacts his revenge on the three men who betrayed him.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Action\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":372981,\"title\":\"Marco Polo: One Hundred Eyes\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/d0rxzDimOAX5QL9jSBz1CsSZpWL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kDS8xqpdL264ccuYaIu5k2W9aG3.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A defiant warrior-monk arrives at Kublai Khan's court in chains and soon earns his tragic nickname in this 30-minute origin story.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"History\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"V6YGfn8-toI\",\"name\":\"HERCULES AGAINST THE MONGOLS, 1963. Mark Forest. Trailer in English.\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}